**Setup Puppeteer:**

```bash
# Cek Node.js
node -v

# Install di workspace RamuToken
cd "D:\backup from pc asus\Documents Development\RamuToken"
npm init -y
npm install puppeteer
```

**Contoh kontrol tab:**
```javascript
const puppeteer = require('puppeteer');

(async () => {
  const browser = await puppeteer.launch({headless: false});
  const page = await browser.newPage();
  await page.goto('https://google.com');
  await page.screenshot({path: 'screenshot.png'});
  // await browser.close();
})();
```

**Apa yang bisa dikontrol:**
- `page.goto(url)` — navigate
- `page.click(selector)` — klik elemen
- `page.type(selector, text)` — input teks
- `page.screenshot()` — ambil gambar
- `page.evaluate(() => {...})` — jalankan JS di page
- `browser.newPage()` — buka tab baru
- `page.close()` — tutup tab

